<title>POLAND: Agros 9.8 pct jump surprises traders.</title>
<headline>Agros 9.8 pct jump surprises traders.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Polish food trader and producer Agros SA soared 9.9 percent to 83.5 zlotys in a 7.1 million zloty turnover on Thursday but traders said they could not explain the scale of the surge.</p>
<p>&quot;It's said investors have a good opinion of the firm, but I can't think of any single piece of information which could have caused such a spectacular surge,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
